  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "A working society desk with an expressive front door.",
    "overview": "SocietyHub pairs a welcoming public entrance with a calm operating workspace for engineering societies and SEC chairs. The dreamy reference informs the landing atmosphere; the completed interface defines compact working composition and stronger Raleway hierarchy.",
